Package: ectR
Title: Minimal R Facade for the ESA Climate Toolbox
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tonio Fincke", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tonio.fincke@brockmann-consult.de")
Description: Provides small R entry points for discovering and opening raster
    and vector data with the Python-based ESA Climate Toolbox through
    reticulate. Opened data remain Python objects so lazy processing is
    preserved.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    reticulate
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
